\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Christ is King over all nations,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and His hand is up on high,
\par false worshippers can't withstand Him
\par He shall come to wipe them off.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Pagans and also the fetish
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0   have a call to be redeemed
\par  Jesus have taken your drums and
\par  all the timbrels and the bells.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.   Even, some of your compatriots
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Have come to the side of Christ;
\par  They have seen the power of Jesus,
\par  And are preaching with His Power.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   4.   Followers of these fetish shrines
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0   Come in multitude to Christ:
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0\qj   Therefore, you too, change up your  minds,
\par \pard     come, and follow Jesus Christ.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

